{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56769","headline":"徐干对顾总诵刘桢小娘子娇羞奉忆诗（题拟） · 不详","name":"徐干对顾总诵刘桢小娘子娇羞奉忆诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆爷[爷]，抛女不归家，不能作侍中，爲小吏，就辛苦，弃荣华，愿爷想念早相见，与儿买李市甘瓜。\n。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56769.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56769","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}